> 3) On about level 25 I got to a level filled with water. How do you cross the
>    water? I had one potion of levetation, but that only got me halfway
>    across. Is there anyway to get a swimming instrisic?

There are at least seven ways to get across a lot of water...  

1:  Quaff a _blessed_ potion of levitation.  Ask to levitate for the maximum
    (300) number of turns.  If you don't dawdle, you should get across with
    plenty of time to spare.
2:  boots of levitation.
3:  ring of levitation.
4:  boots of water walking.
5:  Get rid of the water.  Fire evaporates it, cold freezes it, and pushing
    a boulder in displaces it.  Any one of these turns water into more or
    less solid terrain.
6:  amulet of magical breathing.  This lets you swim, or at least walk on
    the bottom.
7:  try polymorphing into a giant eel or kraken.

Incidentally, watch out for giant eels!  These can wrap themselves around
you and drag you into the drink even if you are levitating!  I lost a good
character discovering this...  I have also had characters drown when a
#@*$ing nymph stole my boots of levitation at a very inopportune moment, 
and it's also possible to die if you get zapped by an electrical attack 
that turns your ring of levitation to powder.  Electric eels come to mind
here...

